# The cf-edge fixture ships dist/index.html verbatim so the Workers-
# with-static-assets shape has a real static asset to serve (parity with
# cf-platform per round-6 T-0). The repo-level .gitignore excludes
# dist/ globally; this exception keeps the fixture's dist/ tracked so a
# fresh clone can boot wrangler dev and the wrangler-seam probe reaches
# workerd. The runtime probe reports under .rcf/reports/ are runtime
# artefacts and stay gitignored.
!dist/
!dist/**
.rcf/reports/
.wrangler/
node_modules/
